{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1310076-aberrant-and-mega-attributes","id":1310076,"title":"Aberrant and Mega Attributes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-05T11:38:14-07:00","id":1310076,"title":"Aberrant and Mega Attributes?","content":"So, I know Aberrant stays pretty streamlined and non game breaking up until mega attributes and all of the auto successes. This is where things get really broken and wonky. I know this from personal experience and when Aberrant was at its hay day is was a common consensus. <br /> <br /> Has anyone developed a house rule to help lessen this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No live organism can continue for long to exist sanely under conditions of absolute reality; even larks and katydids are supposed, by some, to dream.&quot; - Shirley Jackson","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1227-shenron","name":"Shenron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T15:21:27-07:00","id":1310117,"title":"","content":"The idea for 2e is to add scale on the tests, each scale grants 2 \u201csuccesses\u201d or multiply the effect by 5 when it\u2019s descriptive, for example affecting 5 times more people or an area 5 times larger.<br /> <br /> In 1e, the idea is that mega attributes are just awesome, but you can treat the Mega Dice as regular dice, and work on the enhancements as what makes the attributes really great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T20:30:14-07:00","id":1310188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1310076-aberrant-and-mega-attributes?p=1310117#post1310117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The idea for 2e is to add scale on the tests, each scale grants 2 \u201csuccesses\u201d or multiply the effect by 5 when it\u2019s descriptive, for example affecting 5 times more people or an area 5 times larger.<br /> <br /> In 1e, the idea is that mega attributes are just awesome, but you can treat the Mega Dice as regular dice, and work on the enhancements as what makes the attributes really great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah ya. Speaking of 2e is there a place where all the design notes are?<br /> <br /> I guess I should have been more specific regarding what edition. As far as 1e goes to help balance mega attributes using your suggestions and just thinking more about it (back in the day I had it all figured out when I was playing/running it).<br /> <br /> - Mega dice as regular dice <br /> - enhancements as normal <br /> <br /> How should I handle the auto successes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;No live organism can continue for long to exist sanely under conditions of absolute reality; even larks and katydids are supposed, by some, to dream.&quot; - Shirley Jackson","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1227-shenron","name":"Shenron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1227_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T21:07:37-07:00","id":1310198,"title":"","content":"Don\u2019t use auto successes, just throw the dice. If the enhancements are giving extra successes, than use as is.<br /> <br /> About 2e, nothing official yet. They are working on the KS arts, so I guess the next month we may have the KS starting, and have some manuscript to work with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-05T22:25:32-07:00","id":1310213,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1310076-aberrant-and-mega-attributes?p=1310198#post1310198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don\u2019t use auto successes, just throw the dice. If the enhancements are giving extra successes, than use as is.<br /> <br /> About 2e, nothing official yet. They are working on the KS arts, so I guess the next month we may have the KS starting, and have some manuscript to work with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably not next month. Pirates of Pugmire is the next KS, so I can\u2019t imagine the Abby KS happening before late June or early July.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T00:01:08-07:00","id":1310228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jetstream</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1310076-aberrant-and-mega-attributes?p=1310213#post1310213\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Probably not next month. Pirates of Pugmire is the next KS, so I can\u2019t imagine the Abby KS happening before late June or early July.</div> </div> </div> </div>If it's not late June, then it'll be in August; Gen Con's the first few days of August, and they don't have KSes overlapping with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-06T07:54:52-07:00","id":1310286,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1310076-aberrant-and-mega-attributes?p=1310198#post1310198\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Pos